[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5102.149, "timestamp": "01:25:02", "text": "讲述。是的。奥林说得好像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5104.31, "timestamp": "01:25:04", "text": "一种真正的侧身行走。是，是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5104.886, "timestamp": "01:25:04", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "true"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5105.99, "timestamp": "01:25:05", "text": "非常好。感觉就像真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5107.669, "timestamp": "01:25:07", "text": "好的。所以你有个可以散步的地方，不像其他人那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5114.229, "timestamp": "01:25:14", "text": "所以，是的，你的伞可能会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5117.51, "timestamp": "01:25:17", "text": "被盗。所以一定要买便宜的伞。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5120.39, "timestamp": "01:25:20", "text": "便宜的雨伞。而问题是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5122.31, "timestamp": "01:25:22", "text": "他们有一种文化，如果你把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5124.07, "timestamp": "01:25:24", "text": "某处有把伞，然后你就看到了"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5125.802, "timestamp": "01:25:25", "author": "@saikatdey0909", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mT2Up10wsYYwilcayEwYxOCwTgzDSnNztFejTB-x02nR8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6Qo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5126.149, "timestamp": "01:25:26", "text": "一把无人看管的雨伞，就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5127.91, "timestamp": "01:25:27", "text": "透明的。你可以直接拿起它，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5128.029, "timestamp": "01:25:28", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "don't worry the umbrella will only get stolen when you leave it the umbrella container"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5130.47, "timestamp": "01:25:30", "text": "使用后，把它扔到某个地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5132.07, "timestamp": "01:25:32", "text": "就像车站那玩意儿，就挂在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5133.75, "timestamp": "01:25:33", "text": "放在某个地方，以便下一个人可以"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5134.973, "timestamp": "01:25:34", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "like outside stores"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5137.43, "timestamp": "01:25:37", "text": "用完后再用。实际上并非如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5140.79, "timestamp": "01:25:40", "text": "不合法。好的。但人们确实会这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5142.149, "timestamp": "01:25:42", "text": "这种情况很常见。我不知道他们是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5143.91, "timestamp": "01:25:43", "text": "继续这样做。但是人们，我们过去常常这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5145.99, "timestamp": "01:25:45", "text": "那。有一次我忘了带伞。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5147.75, "timestamp": "01:25:47", "text": "就像拿了一把平放的伞一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5149.669, "timestamp": "01:25:49", "text": "掉到某个地方。我刚拿走了。我来了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5156.27, "timestamp": "01:25:56", "text": "车站。当你离开时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5158.55, "timestamp": "01:25:58", "text": "别担心。这把伞只会"}]